  "counterfeit_notes": "Fakes are common on AliExpress, eBay, Amazon JP and Yahoo Auctions. Genuine: soft copper-toned OFC leads, round pin-1 indent, sharp logo. Markings legitimately vary by lot and era. Genuine costs about €33–$44 (Mouser, 2023); far-cheaper listings are suspect.",
